  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green and Blue: Sourcing sustainable fish products from Peru</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dutch Company Green and Blue B.V. has a track-record in the fishing sector and has the ambition to regularly source certified seafood products from Peru, such as scallops, giant squid and mahi mahi. To prepare for future investments and to assess the Peruvian supply chain, Technical Assistance (DGGF-TA) provides support. The project includes partner selection and the pre-financing of the first shipment of frozen seafood products from Peru to the Netherlands for the European market. Upon successful completion, Green and Blue will expand its sourcing activities in Peru which may result in the development of a new and more sustainable and certified product line for local Peruvian processing partners which in turn could result in 180 new jobs and new opportunities for local fishermen.</narrative>
  </description>
